==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Turtwig|7}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Turtwig|131}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*{{m|Bite}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Turtwig}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

